    (shortDescription) Timp is a small, native, album-art-forward music player written in C with raylib. Borderless Hi-Fi window, accent color sampled from the artwork, live spectrum, 10-band EQ, synced lyrics, saved .m3u8 playlists and a slide-out drawer. v0.12.2 ships a real Windows installer built with Forge, a self-contained Timp.app for macOS, and a Hisashi menu bar.
    (date) 2026-09-01
    (image) /images/projects/timp/main.png

