    (shortDescription) Hisashi (庇, Japanese for "eaves") is a plugin-driven top bar for Windows that sits at the top of every monitor. Per-monitor configuration, three zones, 24 bundled plugins, 20 contrast-checked themes, host-rendered toasts, and an OS Window Layer that lets any app in any language publish its menus into a macOS-style menu bar.
